      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "It does not. Persona validates and sends the minimum required data to VRChat to construct the hash.\n\nThe data is then discarded on VRChat's side (it is never saved to disk), and then we tell Persona to delete the data immediately following validation success or failure.\n\nhttps://ask.vrchat.com/t/age-verification-faq/28458#p-58953-how-long-is-my-data-kept-15",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
