  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi, does VRChat use an API that continuously (or every x dates) checks if the user is Persona verified?\n\nI'm asking this because: As soon as I am verified on VRChat with Persona, I was going to send a request to Persona delete all data attached to me. I am worried that if all my data is deleted from Persona, that an API update / change could remove my VRChat age verification.\n\nCheers!",
